1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,950
Bina solve kiye batao —
roots real hain ya nahi?

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,850
Poora solve karne ki zaroorat nahi.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,850
Bas ek number nikaalo — Discriminant.

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,950
D equals b square minus 4ac.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,200
Agar D zero se bada hai —
do alag real roots.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,200
D barabar zero —
do barabar real roots.

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,950
Aur D zero se chhota —
koi real root nahi.

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:21,200
Ab hamara sawaal:
a = 2, b = −4, c = 3.

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,500
D equals minus 4 ka square,
minus 4 into 2 into 3.

10
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,700
Yaani 16 minus 24 — minus 8.

11
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,950
D negative hai, to koi real root nahi.

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,950
Dhyaan rahe: minus 4 ka square plus 16 hota hai,
minus 16 nahi.

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:38,800
Aise hi daily Maths videos ke liye
follow kijiye Neuron Academy.
